{"id":"31fd6b10afa244b4","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-meyers-serrin.md","title":"Meyers-Serrin Theorem","display":"thm-meyers-serrin — Meyers-Serrin Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-meyers-serrin","aliases":["58-thm-meyers-serrin","Meyers-Serrin Theorem"],"display":"thm-meyers-serrin — Meyers-Serrin Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","[[58-df-smooth]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-meyers-serrin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-meyers-serrin</span><span>Meyers-Serrin Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-meyers-serrin — Meyers-Serrin Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"58-df-smooth\">58-df-smooth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq p\">\\(1\\leq p\\)</span>, so only finite Sobolev exponents occur.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in V\">\\(W\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in W\">\\(u\\in W\\)</span>; the conventional notation for this selected set is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)=W\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)=W\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n,\\ |\\alpha|\\leq k}\\|D^\\alpha v\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}\">\\(\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n,\\ |\\alpha|\\leq k}\\|D^\\alpha v\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}meyers\\text{-}serrin}\\vdash\n\\left[n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in\\mathbb R\\land1\\leq p\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\Omega,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\land u\\in W\\right]\n\\to\\exists s\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(s,\\omega,C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq j\\to\n\\left(\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq k}}\n\\|D^\\alpha(s(j)-u)\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}meyers\\text{-}serrin}\\vdash\n\\left[n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in\\mathbb R\\land1\\leq p\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\Omega,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\land u\\in W\\right]\n\\to\\exists s\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(s,\\omega,C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq j\\to\n\\left(\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq k}}\n\\|D^\\alpha(s(j)-u)\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span> is dense in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span> for the displayed range of parameters.</li>\n<li>The convergence clause is expanded in the Sobolev norm rather than delegated to an undeclared predicate.</li>\n<li>The open-domain and finite-real-exponent hypotheses are part of the theorem, and the selected Sobolev set is connected to its upstream five-argument predicate.</li>\n<li>Fractional Sobolev density statements require their own definitions and hypotheses and are not asserted here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Meyers and Serrin, H=W, Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 51 (1964)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq p","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)=W","display":false},{"tex":"\\|v\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n,\\ |\\alpha|\\leq k}\\|D^\\alpha v\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}meyers\\text{-}serrin}\\vdash\n\\left[n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land p\\in\\mathbb R\\land1\\leq p\\land\n\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(\\Omega,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\land u\\in W\\right]\n\\to\\exists s\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(s,\\omega,C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall j\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq j\\to\n\\left(\\sum_{\\substack{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\|\\alpha|\\leq k}}\n\\|D^\\alpha(s(j)-u)\\|_{L^p(\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p}<\\varepsilon\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\cap W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false}],"bytes":2111,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-meyers-serrin.md|58-thm-meyers-serrin]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","17de8347f6f91384","36d7463d215be751"]}